~ start_archangel_dialogue
Archangel Gabriel: [[Welcome, listener of the soul.|Greetings, creator of inner sound.]]
Archangel Gabriel: This is the Chamber of Resonance—where feelings become music and colour.
Archangel Gabriel: Here, even the heaviest thoughts can be transformed into something gentle and meaningful.
Archangel Gabriel : Would you like to create music from your emotions?
- Yes—let’s create something beautiful  
	=> launch_music_minigame
- Maybe later  
	=> END

~ launch_music_minigame
	=> END

~ start_zephyr_dialogue
Everlasting Father: Hey! Ready to lighten your mind?
- Yes, let’s pop some thoughts!
	=> launch_pop_thoughts
- Maybe later
	=> END

~ launch_pop_thoughts
Everlasting Father: *(Everlasting Father waves and points to the portal.)*
Everlasting Father: Loading Pop Thoughts… get ready!
do GameManager.request_pop_thoughts()
=> END

~ start_patron_pallete
Patron Palette: [[Hello, artist!|Greetings, creator!|Hey there!]]  
Patron Palette: Welcome to the Painting Tool. Ready to unleash your creativity?
- Yes—let me paint!
	=> open_painting_tool
- How does it work?
	=> explain_painting_tool
- Maybe later
	=> END

~ explain_painting_tool
Patron Palette: In the Painting Tool you get:  
• A full colour palette to mix any hue you like  
• Layer controls for organising your strokes  
• Undo/Redo for fearless experimentation  
Patron Palette: Want to jump in now?
- Absolutely—launch it!
	=> open_painting_tool
- Not just yet
	=> END

~ open_painting_tool
Patron Palette: Here we go—happy painting!  
do GameManager.request_paingting()
=> END

~ start_maestro_montclair
Curator Ithiel: [[Welcome, art lover!|Greetings, connoisseur!|Hello there!]]  
Curator Ithiel: You’ve arrived at the Grand Art Gallery. What would you like to do?
- Browse the gallery
	=> open_art_gallery
- Tell me about the gallery
	=> explain_gallery
- Maybe later
	=> END

~ explain_gallery
Curator Ithiel: Here you can admire masterpieces from around the world—paintings, sculptures, and interactive installations.  
Curator Ithiel: Use the arrow keys or click on any piece to view details of each work.  
Curator Ithiel: Ready to explore?
- Yes—show me the art!
	=> open_art_gallery
- Not right now
	=> END

~ open_art_gallery
Curator Ithiel: Wonderful choice—let the inspiration begin!
do GameManager.request_art_gallery()
=> END


~ start_therapist_npc
Wonderful Counsellor: Hey there, I’m Wonderful Counsellor 🐾  
Wonderful Counsellor: I’ll be your guide in this creative healing journey.  

Wonderful Counsellor: This world was made for you to relax, make art, and feel good on the inside.  
Wonderful Counsellor: No pressure. Just expression, imagination, and kindness.  

Wonderful Counsellor: Ready to enter the healing studio?
- Yes—let’s begin  
	=> enter_healing_journey
- Tell me more about Artéa  
	=> explain_artea
- About Louisa (website)  
	=> open_louisa_site
- Maybe later  
	=> END

~ explain_artea
Wonderful Counsellor: Artéa is a place of color and calm—designed to help you unwind through creativity.  
Wonderful Counsellor: Explore painting tools, pop thought-clouds, or simply gaze at the gallery.  
Wonderful Counsellor: Your inner world matters. Let’s make it brighter!
- I’m ready now  
	=> enter_healing_journey
- Back  
	=> start_therapist_npc

~ enter_healing_journey
Wonderful Counsellor: Wonderful—step right in and let the healing begin!  
do GameManager.request_Art_Therapy()
=> END

~ open_louisa_site
Wonderful Counsellor: Louisa is the visionary behind this space. You can learn more about her in her website
- Visit Website
	=> visit_website
- Maybe Later
=> END

~ visit_website
do GameManager.request_visit_website()
=> start_therapist_npc

~ END
Nathan: See you next time!
